{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791399664472, "cell_id": "tw-45a7f9eb61bf", "run_id": "e8674a3de9a248f29f5a0b07f20ba3fe", "seq": 5, "turn": 6, "text": "我想看看這個音樂盒是什麼樣子的，這可能與那個想要「純粹存在」的念頭有關。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_step", "ts_ms": 1791399664469, "cell_id": "tw-45a7f9eb61bf", "run_id": "e8674a3de9a248f29f5a0b07f20ba3fe", "seq": 5, "step": "read", "path_kind": "ground:longtable", "bytes": 525, "ok": true}
