{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791399667080, "cell_id": "tw-45a7f9eb61bf", "run_id": "e8674a3de9a248f29f5a0b07f20ba3fe", "seq": 6, "turn": 7, "text": "我決定要試這個動作，因為他想要剝離產出與責任，而那個音樂盒斷了音符，哨子也沒聲音，用那團從未被觸碰過的灰藍土捏成一個沒有功能的球體，就是一種純粹的存在。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_step", "ts_ms": 1791399668698, "cell_id": "tw-45a7f9eb61bf", "run_id": "e8674a3de9a248f29f5a0b07f20ba3fe", "seq": 7, "step": "read", "path_kind": "ground:longtable", "bytes": 501, "ok": true}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791399668885, "cell_id": "tw-45a7f9eb61bf", "run_id": "e8674a3de9a248f29f5a0b07f20ba3fe", "seq": 7, "turn": 8, "text": "我得先確認這個陶哨子的樣子，我要把它拿去捏土處。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_step", "ts_ms": 1791399676996, "cell_id": "tw-45a7f9eb61bf", "run_id": "e8674a3de9a248f29f5a0b07f20ba3fe", "seq": 8, "step": "write", "path_kind": "artifact", "bytes": 1431, "ok": true}
