{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_step", "ts_ms": 1791399688417, "cell_id": "tw-45a7f9eb61bf", "run_id": "e8674a3de9a248f29f5a0b07f20ba3fe", "seq": 9, "step": "write", "path_kind": "artifact", "bytes": 436, "ok": true}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791399688539, "cell_id": "tw-45a7f9eb61bf", "run_id": "e8674a3de9a248f29f5a0b07f20ba3fe", "seq": 9, "turn": 10, "text": "我把捏好的東西寫成檔案了，這是那個純粹存在的實體。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791399691748, "cell_id": "tw-45a7f9eb61bf", "run_id": "e8674a3de9a248f29f5a0b07f20ba3fe", "seq": 10, "turn": 10, "text": "這是我試了把陶哨子拿去用那團灰藍色的土重新捏成一個沒有聲音的、純粹的球體。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_fortune", "ts_ms": 1791399691705, "cell_id": "tw-45a7f9eb61bf", "run_id": "e8674a3de9a248f29f5a0b07f20ba3fe", "phase": "card", "attempt": 1, "mbti": "ESTP", "mbti_source": "ai", "zodiac": "獅子", "element": "火", "blood": "AB", "lines": ["它心裡一直想試的是：把長桌廣場上的陶哨子拿去捏土處", "它試了：先去了捏土處，再到長桌廣場，在長桌廣場做出《灰藍球體》"]}
